OL,3,ABadenoch says Tories would scrap
OL,4,Ainheritance tax on family homes and
OL,5,Aincrease couples' threshold to #1m
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer speech also outlines how she says
OL,8,Fher party will look to boost growth,
OL,9,Fcreate jobs, cut energy costs, cut
OL,10,Fwelfare, tackle crime and pay for
OL,11,Fdefence, adding the Tories face a
OL,12,F"battle for the soul of the nation"
OL,14,FBadenoch says the world is becoming
OL,15,Fmore dangerous and western economies
OL,16,Fmore fragile and that "we are running
OL,17,Fout of money and running out of time to
OL,18,Fput it right"
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/41
